    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No lip or mouth sores; no trouble swallowing</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or blood in sputum</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest tightness or leg swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Rough spots on the backs of both hands, as found at the preventive visit</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

